#### Get User Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

#### Update Usage Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/update-usage-data
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "usageData": [
        {
            "app": "Instagram",
            "packageName": "com.instagram.android",
            "usage": 4500,
            "currentTimeStamp": "2025-08-24T12:00:00Z"
        },
        {
            "app": "Snapchat",
            "packageName": "com.snapchat.android",
            "usage": 7000,
            "currentTimeStamp": "2025-08-24T12:00:00Z"
        },
        {
            "app": "Facebook",
            "packageName": "com.facebook.katana",
            "usage": 5200,
            "currentTimeStamp": "2025-08-24T12:00:00Z"
        }
    ]
}

#### Get All Achievements
GET {{baseUrl}}/achievements
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

#### Get All Missions
GET {{baseUrl}}/missions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

#### Mark Mission as Complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/missions/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "missionId": "1"
}